flowchart TB
  U[Research director / Browser] --> API[Campus API: identity and commands]
  API --> CORE[Policy + Budget + Registry + Audit]
  CORE --> WF[Durable workflows / Temporal]
  WF --> AG[Specialized agent runs]
  AG --> SEL[Task router: shortlist and reasoned selection]
  SEL --> GATE[Trusted route authorization]
  GATE --> LLM[LLM Gateway / approved adapters]
  LLM --> EXT[Configured external or local models]
  AG --> TB[Tool Broker]
  TB --> NET[Internet service / controlled egress]
  NET --> WEB[Public and licensed sources]
  TB --> SB[Isolated execution controller]
  SB --> JOB[Disposable research sandbox]
  CORE --> DATA[(Postgres + artifact store)]
  AG --> REVIEW[Distinct review instances]
  REVIEW --> SEL
  REVIEW --> DATA
